THE WHOLE SEQUENCE, chained: search-from-scratch vs developmental (block -> translate -> refine)
translation-invariant motif task, 24 train examples (scarce), 12 seeds x 3 restarts.

  phase                                   | test acc
  (1) search from scratch (P independent) | 0.629   <- the worsening: starves
  (2) find a stable block + (3) translate | 0.899   <- reuse, no re-search
  (4) refine in place, no jitter          | 0.876
  (4) refine in place, + jitter (anneal)  | 0.786

developmental payoff = (2) over (1); jitter matters only if (4)+jitter clearly beats no-jitter.
